# ex36 moisture 3x3 lattice (mirrors demos/8-gamma/076-farm-gamma.bqn moisture section)
# moisture 1..9 row-major (the .bqn m = 3x3 reshape of 1+iota 9); cnt starts at -1 sentinels.
# neighbors: 4-stencil fibers, boundary shrunk, linear ids row*3+col, ascending.
lattice 3 3
field plot bool 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
field moisture num 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9
field cnt num -1 -1 -1 -1 -1 -1 -1 -1 -1
srel neighbors 1 3 | 0 2 4 | 1 5 | 0 4 6 | 1 3 5 7 | 2 4 8 | 3 7 | 4 6 8 | 5 7
ja 区画 plot
ja 湿気 moisture
ja 個数 cnt
ja 隣人 neighbors
